<section id="over">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="over-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="section-label">About me</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">About <em>me</em></h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p class="body-text">I am a connector with a sharp eye for what can be better, and with the energy to actually set things in motion. At 15 I started my first business, driven by the urge to fix what wasn't working. Yet I then chose the conventional path: I studied in Utrecht, Dublin and Amsterdam, and accepted a position in government.</p>
        <p class="body-text">But something chafed. The fixed frameworks of the system didn't fit me. After five years and two long journeys, I decided to return to my entrepreneurial nature. I made the move to the business world, where I worked for years with fast-growing startups and international scale-ups in tech.</p>
        <p class="body-text">The loss of my father and the insights from his illness brought me back to the essence of what truly matters to me: listening to the body, living from connection, and building something that genuinely makes the world better.</p>
        <p class="body-text">After a period of personal deepening and a sabbatical with my family, I decided in 2023 to devote my life to my life's mission: honouring the connection between body, mind, society and earth through the realisation of <strong><a href="https://www.healinggrounds.org" target="_blank">Healing Grounds</a></strong>.</p>
        <p class="body-text">My work for entrepreneurs grew alongside this. Since 2026 I integrate building Go-to-Market strategies with the energetic connection between entrepreneur and creation. I help entrepreneurs translate insights from a deeper awareness into a concrete, grounded strategy for their business.</p>
        <p class="body-text">I am honest, sharp and gentle at once. Present in the moment and in what it asks of me (and still very much human, not a Buddha).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="over-photo">
        <img src="/images/img-hg.jpeg" alt="Isabel Brouwer at Healing Grounds" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

