<section id="aanbod" class="aanbod-bg">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="section-label">Offerings</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Guiding from <em>connection</em></h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p class="body-text">I have woven my background in the dynamic startup world together with energetic work. Through my work for <strong><a href="https://www.healinggrounds.org" target="_blank">Healing Grounds</a></strong>, a second direction has emerged: the in-depth conversations I have with health professionals proved so powerful that I now offer this as a standalone service.</p>
    <div class="aanbod-grid">
      <div class="card card-alt">
        <span class="card-tag tag-clay">Entrepreneurs</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">Growth Guide</h3>
        <div class="card-text">
          <p><strong>Growth from connection</strong></p>
          <p style="margin-top:0.75rem">As an (inter)national growth guide I help founders achieve impactful growth. I am not a coach for entrepreneurs, but a guide for your business.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:0.5rem">I bring in the heart of the entrepreneur to clarify the direction of the enterprise.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem"><strong>How we can work together</strong></p>
          <ul style="margin-top:0.5rem">
            <li><strong>A day in the field of your enterprise:</strong> An intensive session where we filter out the noise through movement, breathwork and meditation. We tune in to what your business is here to bring and what it needs right now. We end with a concrete next step. <em>From &euro;1,950 excl. VAT.</em></li>
            <li style="margin-top:0.75rem"><strong>Strategy &amp; GTM guidance:</strong> For building and validating (international) Go-to-Market strategies. A process of 6 to 9 months in which we discover the most promising first or next market. <em>From &euro;18,500 excl. VAT.</em></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:1.5rem;">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-gold">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-sage">
        <span class="card-tag tag-sage">Health professionals</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">The essence of your practice, clearly articulated</h3>
        <div class="card-text">
          <p>Many health professionals know deep down what they do and for whom, yet find it hard to put into words. Through an in-depth conversation, partly guided by meditation, I bring the core of your work to the surface. What remains is clear language that resonates: for your website, your bio and all your communications.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:0.75rem"><em>This method works best if you already have clients and (sometimes) experience flow with them. They are the living proof of what you offer.</em></p>
          <p style="margin-top:0.75rem"><em>From &euro;950 excl. VAT. Including building a homepage: from &euro;2,750 excl. VAT.</em></p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:1.5rem;">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-gold">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

