    <h2 class="section-title">In <em>dialogue</em></h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p class="body-text">I love sharing my perspective on the connection between body and mind, and its impact on how we live and work. Whether on a stage, in a boardroom, or via a podcast, my goal is always to raise awareness of this essence and start the conversation. I am equally at home doing this in English and in Dutch.</p>
    <p class="body-text" style="margin-top:1rem"><strong>Speaking and guest appearances</strong><br>Looking for a speaker who moves people and lets them experience the connection between body and mind in the room? Or a guest for a podcast on consciousness and leadership? I love sharing my story to create movement. Let's explore the possibilities.</p>
